# Current koupa image versions: the single source of truth, read by the
# Makefile, measure.sh, scripts/*.sh, experiments/ and the tests.
#
# Semantic versioning, Kubernetes style: vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH. MAJOR is the
# line (1 = the base app, 2 = with 售完標示), MINOR = new features, PATCH =
# bug fixes. A published tag is never overwritten: change the app, bump the
# version here (both lines), then scripts/publish-images.sh. k8s/base must
# use KOUPA_V1_TAG (scripts/check-manifests.sh checks it).
#
# Plain KEY=value lines only: make includes this file, bash sources it.
KOUPA_REPO=ghcr.io/braveantony/koupa
KOUPA_V1_TAG=v1.2.1
KOUPA_V2_TAG=v2.2.1
